- Implemented support for DLC.

- Added a new difficulty mode <MASSIVE ATTACK>. The new 
  difficulty mode becomes available as soon as <EXTRA HARD> 
  is unlocked.

- Added a skip function for replay mode. Press R1 to skip one
  stage. This function is not available in the last stage of 
  the replay!

- Made several minor improvements.

- Addressed a few minor problems.